{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28390","headline":"新转南曹未叙朝散初秋暑退出守吴兴书此篇以自见志 · 杜牧","name":"新转南曹未叙朝散初秋暑退出守吴兴书此篇以自见志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捧诏汀洲去，全家羽翼飞。\n喜抛新锦帐，荣借旧朱衣。\n且免材爲累，何妨拙有机。\n宋株聊自守，鲁酒怕旁围。\n清尚宁无素，光阴亦未曦。\n一盃宽幕席，五字弄珠玑。\n越浦黄柑嫩，吴溪紫蟹肥。\n平生江海志，佩得左鱼归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}